--- chat-ws-server.js ---
@sig 68171036
class ChatWsServer|7m|upgrades chat sockets and binds chat sessions to agent task streams
  .handleUpgrade()|creates WS server and dispatches chat.send/resume/cancel messages
  ._handleChatSend()|creates or resolves chat, delegates prompt, subscribes to task id
  ._handleChatResume()|resubscribes existing task and recovers completed/lost state
  ._handleChatCancel()|resolves task id and forwards cancel_task to agent-pool
  .subscribe()|adds websocket client to task subscription and maps task to chat
  .unsubscribe()|removes all websocket clients for a task
  .broadcastTaskEvent()|sends task event payloads with chat ownership metadata
  CALLS→data.toString,JSON.parse,_handleChatSend,_handleChatResume,_handleChatCancel,console.error,JSON.stringify,ws.send
PATTERNS: task-id subscription map|chat/task ownership map|StateGraph resume recovery
EDGE_CASES: CLI-created chat fallback|lost in-memory task after restart|dead pid recovery errors
